{"version":1,"content":"<p>哈利波特迷係時候出動喇！人氣店「再睡 5 分鐘」將於 10月27日推出《哈利波特》跨界聯乘「霍格華茲課程系列」！今次以四大經典課程為靈感，打造出4款夢幻特飲。只需$59組合價，就可以一口氣入手特飲連限定變色隨行杯！4款主題特飲包括以飛行課為靈感嘅「焦糖布丁歐蕾🍮」、藥草學「桂花仙草歐蕾🌿」、魔咒學「葡萄藍柑沙沙🍇」以及奇獸學「蘋果莓莓沙沙🍎」。</p>\n<p>只要購買任一主題飲品，仲可以不限組數加購多款質感爆燈嘅限定周邊（$69 起），推介手感極佳嘅毛茸茸「怪獸書 14 吋筆電包」同埋神還原嘅「光輪 2000 兩用抱枕毯」！活動於 2026 年 10 月 27 日在全港再睡 5 分鐘門市正式開賣，各位巫師同麻瓜們記得準時去掃貨全套收藏喇！</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202431041794_13943995226ad790187f68b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202596892129_18842131906ad7901a26cfe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202764951967_1151431516ad7901bc05c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179251202902311398_8804740266ad7901d2d77f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Det_1cpk_cU/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e5%90%83%e5%96%9d%e7%8e%a9%e6%a8%82-%e5%93%88%e5%88%a9%e6%b3%a2%e7%89%b9-%e5%86%8d%e7%9d%a15%e5%88%86%e9%90%98-ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8-ww01-3526767/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「再睡5分鐘」X《哈利波特》系列 4款霍格華茲特飲/魔法變色杯/怪獸書袋</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期</a>.</p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:21:20.342777+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":493,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:00:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T16:37:44.709043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:47.701952+00:00","content_hash":"1137e5f195cf53c4007679e06ce40f75b224910f402df41b9802148ce40ed44d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 404","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}